# Vercel CLI upload exclusions.
#
# A `vercel deploy` from this working tree on 2026-10-06 uploaded .env, and
# ADMIN_PANEL_PRODUCTION_ENABLED=false inside it flipped the admin kill switch
# in src/proxy.ts — https://keebforge.in/admin returned an empty 404 until the
# next Git deploy. Git deploys never ship these files, so CLI deploys must not
# either. Built-in exclusions (.git, .next, node_modules, .vercel) are listed
# explicitly in case this file replaces them.

# local secrets / env
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.e2e

# tooling / local-only state
.git
.gitignore
.next
node_modules
.vercel
.opencode/
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
opencode.json
deploy-checklist.md

# archived audit report copies
docs/MD-FILES/
